description:
[measured] Is this Hyperliquid wallet a good trader? PnL and ROI by day, week, month and all time;
    win rate, profit factor, average win and loss and fees over its last 2,000 fills; favorite coins;
    leverage habits and how often it sat within 5% of liquidation (our hourly snapshots); open
    positions now. Priced: $0.02 per call (x402), 4 credits, or a key's quota.
